        "TileImage": "$($repository 739b0044-c2c1-4487-8222-675bf8eaf9cd).Image",
        "Description": "Our client is a major company for delivering goods. Recently, two of their drivers has gotten into a collision with a biker. A private investigator has also been contracted to investigate this collision. Our client would like to exterminate these threats to prevent bad press. For the sum of $500,000 USD, eliminate the biker, PI, and two drivers. Eliminate All Targets.",
